      "writtenOn": "2021-08-11T21:17:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "how can we make sure fast randoms are never returned to the user? if you can get one through GetRandom, for example, predicting the next generated values will be trivial.\n\ndoes it make sense to mix it in with a constant but never revealed value initialized through TRNG?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "cfb14a23f51d5fbdd336a61f90e889e220e93bea",
