      },
      "lineNbr": 33,
      "author": {
        "id": 1324172
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-08-11T23:51:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "we return an error code if DRBG failed (say, reseed required) and check it during signing. also, initial value now set from TRNG - see fips_rand() change where system-wide DRBG is initialized. this function is used in few places only so far.",
      "parentUuid": "f55ed508_72593e35",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 33,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 33,
        "endChar": 32
      },
      "revId": "cfb14a23f51d5fbdd336a61f90e889e220e93bea",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
